s/94358"} "Tian Jia"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/112497"} "Wang Jie"] ", a rematch of the 2007 World Championships final. Tian and Wang led the first set at 18-17, but May-Treanor and Walsh won the last four points to prevail, 21-18. The Americans got an early lead in the second set, but the Chinese pulled back to lead 9-8. However, May-Treanor and Walsh had too much in the end and won, 21-18, 21-18. The second Chinese team of " [:a {:href "/athletes/112494"} "Xue Chen"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/112501"} "Zhang Xi"] " won the bronze medal."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button659796", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button659796').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Matches Played"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Wins"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Losses"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Sets"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Service Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Service Faults"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Service Aces"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Fastest Serve"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Attack Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Attack Successes"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Block Successes"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Opponent Errors"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Dig Successes"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "United States 1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {:cl